        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, mice have pointed their whiskers to the night sky and marveled at “The Big Cheese”. Emulate your human predecessors. Harness the power of explosions to propel yourself skyward and claim the biggest cheese, the Moon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seize the Cheese, because you can never have enough cheddar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778900/extras/6c7add10441bb6abe9687d4b907a7aff.poster.avif?t=1760458214\" width=1004 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778900/extras/6c7add10441bb6abe9687d4b907a7aff.webm?t=1760458214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778900/extras/6c7add10441bb6abe9687d4b907a7aff.mp4?t=1760458214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use explosive innovation to propel yourself up and beyond. Master the precise art of The Bomb™ to reach new heights as you work your way to the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step 1: Place The Bomb™ &amp; place yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step 2: Detonate The Bomb™.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step 3: Be somewhere else, ideally higher than Step 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs on moderately modern potatoes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All progress is auto-saved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All failure is auto-saved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go forth, explode into greatness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Message from Your CEO:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m your CEO and it’s <i>grate</i> to see all of you here as we take this important opportunity to focus on the <i>whey</i> forward. As many of you know, last quarter wasn’t <i>cheesygoing</i>. It’s fine to <i>brie</i> a little <i>bleu</i> after the latest earnings report. Yes, a <i>string</i> of bad investments aged like <i>milk</i>, but I believe in our <i>culture</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By a <i>quark</i> of fate, we found a <i>muenster</i> of a cheese stash, right above our noses! This quarter we’re shooting for the moon! Literally. The moon is, in fact, made of cheese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I, your Chief Explosives Officer, will <i>dairy</i> to go where no rodent has gone before! We’re going to blow up the Moon and collect every last piece. As such, the company now aligns under the new “Seize the Cheese” initiative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S<i>wiss</i> you all the best,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CEO</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, mice have pointed their whiskers to the night sky and marveled at “The Big Cheese”. Emulate your human predecessors. Harness the power of explosions to propel yourself skyward and claim the biggest cheese, the Moon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seize the Cheese, because you can never have enough cheddar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778900/extras/6c7add10441bb6abe9687d4b907a7aff.poster.avif?t=1760458214\" width=1004 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778900/extras/6c7add10441bb6abe9687d4b907a7aff.webm?t=1760458214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778900/extras/6c7add10441bb6abe9687d4b907a7aff.mp4?t=1760458214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use explosive innovation to propel yourself up and beyond. Master the precise art of The Bomb™ to reach new heights as you work your way to the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step 1: Place The Bomb™ &amp; place yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step 2: Detonate The Bomb™.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step 3: Be somewhere else, ideally higher than Step 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs on moderately modern potatoes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All progress is auto-saved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All failure is auto-saved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go forth, explode into greatness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Message from Your CEO:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m your CEO and it’s <i>grate</i> to see all of you here as we take this important opportunity to focus on the <i>whey</i> forward. As many of you know, last quarter wasn’t <i>cheesygoing</i>. It’s fine to <i>brie</i> a little <i>bleu</i> after the latest earnings report. Yes, a <i>string</i> of bad investments aged like <i>milk</i>, but I believe in our <i>culture</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By a <i>quark</i> of fate, we found a <i>muenster</i> of a cheese stash, right above our noses! This quarter we’re shooting for the moon! Literally. The moon is, in fact, made of cheese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I, your Chief Explosives Officer, will <i>dairy</i> to go where no rodent has gone before! We’re going to blow up the Moon and collect every last piece. As such, the company now aligns under the new “Seize the Cheese” initiative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S<i>wiss</i> you all the best,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CEO</p>",
